   322|  {id:'em5',pipeline:'SaaS',day:5,subject:'\"How long does setup take?\" and other top questions',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nBased on demos with business owners like you, here are the top questions we receive:\n\n1. \"I\'m not technical — can I really set this up?\"\nYes! Our onboarding specialists handle the technical setup. You focus on your content and clients.\n\n2. \"How long until I\'m live?\"\nMost clients launch their first offer within 4-6 weeks of starting.\n\n3. \"What kind of support do you provide?\"\n- Dedicated onboarding specialist (first 60 days)\n- Weekly group office hours\n- 24/7 ticket-based support\n- Ongoing strategy consultations available\n\n4. \"Can I migrate from my current tools?\"\nAbsolutely. We help migrate content, client data, and payment settings from platforms like Kajabi, Teachable, and Thinkific.\n\n5. \"What if I want to change my offer later?\"\nMIFECO is designed for evolution. Update your content, pricing, or structure anytime — no developer needed.\n\nStill wondering if it\'s right for you? Let\'s talk:\n👉 [Book Your No-Pressure Consultation](https://mifeco.com/consult)',cta:'Book Your No-Pressure Consultation at https://mifeco.com/consult'},
   323|  {id:'em6',pipeline:'SaaS',day:6,subject:'🚀 Founding Partner pricing — lock in lifetime savings (ends Friday)',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nI\'ve enjoyed our conversations about how MIFECO could work for your business, and I want to extend a special founding partner opportunity:\n\nFor the next 5 days only, you can lock in lifetime founding partner pricing — which means:\n- 🔒 Never pay a price increase as we add features\n- 💰 Save 40% vs. standard pricing (forever)\n- 🚀 Priority feature requests — help shape the roadmap\n- 👥 Exclusive access to our founder mastermind group\n- 🎁 BONUS: 3 months of done-for-you setup assistance\n\nThis offer expires Friday at midnight. After that, founding partner pricing closes permanently.\n\n👉 [Claim Your Founding Partner Spot](https://mifeco.com/founding-partner)\n\nBest,\nBob\nMIFECO',cta:'Claim Your Founding Partner Spot at https://mifeco.com/founding-partner'},
