   337|  {id:'em17',pipeline:'TestCorp',day:30,subject:'TestCorp\'s AI Roadmap — 437% ROI Is Waiting for Your Go-Ahead 🚀',body:'Hi Alice,\n\nSix weeks ago, we delivered your AI Strategy Assessment. I\'ve been thinking about what I wrote then — and I want to be more direct about what\'s actually on the table for TestCorp.\n\nHere\'s the hard truth: Every week that passes without automating your data entry pipeline, TestCorp loses roughly $1,400–$2,100 in recoverable labor value.\n\nThe assessment wasn\'t theoretical. Let me give you the real numbers:\n\nWhat TestCorp Stands to Gain:\n- Manual data entry hours/week: 40–60 hrs → <25 hrs (Week 8)\n- Customer inquiry response time: 4–24 hours → <1 hour (Week 12)\n- Data entry accuracy: ~85% → 95%+ (Week 6)\n- Internal status-check messages: High → -40% (Week 12)\n\nFinancial picture:\n- Conservative: $83,240 annual savings, 262% ROI\n- Realistic: $112,800 annual savings, 350% ROI\n- Optimistic: $144,360 annual savings, 437% ROI\n\nTwo paths forward:\nPath 1: Deep-Dive Workshop — $1,499\nPath 2: Full Transformation — $3,999 (Recommended)\n\nI\'d like to schedule a 15-minute call this week to decide which path fits.\n\nBest,\nMIFECO Consulting Team',cta:'Reply to schedule your 15-min call'}
